108.00 627.40 426.90  ("So ye think ye want to be an adventurer, eh?"  After scanning you over, he continues.  "Certainly ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 615.40 435.30  (don't look the type, all sissified and soft.  Ye'll be running for yer wetnurse soon enough, I'll warrant.  ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 603.40 397.60  (But if ye want to play with the big boys, ye've come to the right place.  Ye want to be rich, ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 591.40 328.60  (famous, an' powerful like the rest, don't ye?  Aye, else ye wouldn't be here.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 567.40 423.00  (Well, don't be thinkin' this is a cakewalk.  Ye'll be payin' yer dues, and there's plenty of 'em to be ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 555.40 415.10  (paid.  By the way, me name's Joe Mollicone.  Ye can call me 'Sir', or 'Mr. Mollicone', or simply ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 543.40 423.60  ('Taxman', that's what I does here, but don't let me catch ye badmouthin' me behind me back.") js
0 15 div sg
108.00 519.40 423.20  (As he turns to leave, he shouts behind him.  "Personally, I don't think ye has what it takes.  Best to ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 507.40 211.40  (run yer yellow butt back to where it came from.") js
