108.00 479.40 471.40  (RPGBBS Deluxe is basically a bulletin board built around a medieval role-playing ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 465.00 507.40  (atmosphere \(or is it the other way around?\).  Though it has the standard BBS functions, ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 450.60 507.40  (such as a message base, file section, and e-mail, there are no online games.  Instead, you ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 436.20 507.40  (LIVE the online game as you kill, rob from, brawl, and joust the other members to gain ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 421.80 103.00  (levels and fortune.) js
