108.00 569.80 433.70  ("Aye, but ye're a weak one, ain't ye?  Ye better pu on some pounds before ye takes on the likes of ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 557.80 412.60  (me an' me men.  Oh, don't look so surprised, cur.  I'll be back around when ye get somethin' ) js
0 15 div sg
