0 15 div sg
(\267) 108.00 462.60  ms
0 15 div sg
117.00 462.60 433.90  (Experience Level: This indicates how powerful in your class you are.  You raise ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 448.20 454.90  (levels by gaining experience points for killing monsters and other users.  With each ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 433.80 456.40  (increase in level, you will gain more Hit Points, Spell Power \(if used by your class\), ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 419.40 213.60  (and a bonus to the four characteristics.) js
0 15 div sg
(\267) 108.00 390.60  ms
0 15 div sg
117.00 390.60 454.40  (Hit Points: This measures a character's durability.  The more Hit Points you have, ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 376.20 461.30  (the more damage you can take.  When your Hit Points are down, you can raise them ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 361.80 444.40  (by visiting Butler Hospital, gaining an experience level, or casting Heal or Cure.  ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 347.40 309.60  (Each time you log on your Hit Points are restored to full.) js
0 15 div sg
(\267) 108.00 318.60  ms
0 15 div sg
117.00 318.60 458.60  (Spell Power: This is how much magical energy a character has at their disposal.  If ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 304.20 461.40  (the character class uses spells or scrolls, there will be an accompanying Spell Power ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 289.80 449.90  (requirement for casting each.  Those classes that use wands do not have to expend ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 275.40 135.80  (any force to invoke them.) js
0 15 div sg
(\267) 108.00 246.60  ms
0 15 div sg
117.00 246.60 453.80  (Stamina: This tracks how hard a character hits.  Characters with higher Stamina ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 232.20 455.10  (gain more Hit Points when advancing to the next Experience Level.  More Stamina ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 217.80 203.90  (yields more damage in melee attacks.) js
0 15 div sg
(\267) 108.00 189.00  ms
0 15 div sg
117.00 189.00 456.60  (Intellect: This statistic comes into play mainly in casting and resisting magic.  It is ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 174.60 459.60  (also calculated into approximating an opponent's Hit Points.  Bonus Spell Power is ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 160.20 325.60  (awarded to those with a high Intellect upon gaining a level.) js
0 15 div sg
(\267) 108.00 131.40  ms
0 15 div sg
117.00 131.40 442.20  (Agility: Your overall fighting ability is measured by how dexterous you are.  It is ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 117.00 442.40  (used to calculate who gets the first attack in a battle round, whether contact was ) js
0 15 div sg
117.00 102.60 428.80  (made, jousting ability, and in catching the edge of a trap door in the Dungeon.) js
