259.00 285.00 130.00  (The Arena) js
0 100 10.00 /AvGuard-Italic /font7 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 238.60 411.40  ("Think ye're a force to reckon with, do ye?  Well, the monsters and your fellow grubs will put ye ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 226.60 414.50  (back in yer place, that I assure ye.  Better stick to somethin' safe, like joustin'... or needlepoint!") js
0 100 12.00 /NewCenturySchlbk-Roman /font6 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 198.60 471.40  (The arena is the proving grounds, where you test your mettle against monsters and ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 184.20 507.40  (other users.  It is relatively safe, as you can retreat at any time, but do not get too ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 169.80 507.40  (complacent - if you wait until you are too far down on Hit Points you may get killed by a ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 155.40 507.40  (powerful blow before you can escape.  You can do battle against other users here by typing ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 141.00 507.40  ("U" and providing the levels you want listed.  You can only fight someone higher than or ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 126.60 507.40  (up to three levels below you.  If you win, you receive experience points, any money they ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 112.20 507.40  (might have in their hand, and their Blessing, if they have one.  You\240will also get their ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 97.80 507.40  (armor and weapon \(if it is better than yours\) or its equivalent cash value \(if yours is ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 83.40 452.20  (better\).  If you are killed, however, your opponent will receive the above from you.) js
