0 15 div sg
108.00 741.00 471.40  (When you kill a user, they will remain dead until either they log on again or are ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 726.60 507.40  (Resurrected.  If you kill a user of higher level than you, they will only be worth the ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 712.20 507.40  (experience points of your level until they log on again.  For example, you kill a level 25 ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 697.80 507.40  (Fighter when you are at level 18.  If that player becomes Alive! again, the attacker that ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 683.40 398.10  (kills him again, in the interim, will only gain level 18 experience points.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 654.60 471.40  (Several semi-intelligent denizens like to compete for cash and prizes as well.  When ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 640.20 507.40  (doing a Monster Fight, start at the bottom and work your way up slowly.  You may do up ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 625.80 384.70  (to three Monster or User Fights per call \(or any combination thereof\).) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 597.00 471.40  (The Arena also features a jousting field.  Here you enter a best-of-five-passes match ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 582.60 507.40  (against a user you specify.  Each win increases your Joust Status by two points, each loss ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 568.20 507.40  (decreases it by one point.  If you win, you will get a set amount of money, determined by ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 553.80 507.40  (the Experience Level of your opponent.  If you lose, your opponent receives the money for ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 539.40 507.40  (your level.  You will also gain Joust Status points upon gaining a level.  You may joust up ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 525.00 125.10  (to three times per call.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 496.20 471.40  (You can also cast a non-combat spell and poison your weapon here to ready yourself ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 481.80 507.40  (for battle.  In addition to this, you may type "Y" to bring up a mini-status screen.  There is ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 467.40 507.40  (even an alley that leads to the Square, but be forewarned - another user may "accidentally ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 453.00 208.70  (bump" you and pick your pocket here.) js
0 100 24.00 /NewCenturySchlbk-Bold /font5 font
0 15 div sg
225.70 400.20 196.70  (Bulletin Boards) js
0 100 10.00 /AvGuard-Italic /font7 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 353.80 429.10  ("No man be an island, though Tiny is gettin' close to the size.  A sissy like yerself will do best to stay ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 341.80 433.00  (in one of these safe areas.  The King likes to see his subjects talkin' to each other, so ye best get in ) js
0 15 div sg
