0 100 10.00 /AvGuard-Italic /font7 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 555.40 430.40  ("If ye want a REAL challenge, go kill some monsters in the Dungeon - that's where the real money ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 543.40 418.40  (lies.  If ye're not scared, that is.  Best watch out, though, 'cuz there's plenty of surprises to trip ye ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 531.40 426.10  (up.  And if ye run into another limp-livered coward like yerself down there, he's like to mistake yer ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 519.40 434.30  (ugly face for a monster and attack.  Maybe ye'll even find the Legendary Wishin' Well down there, ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 507.40 210.60  (but ye'd probably mistake it for a chamberpot.") js
0 100 12.00 /NewCenturySchlbk-Roman /font6 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 479.40 471.40  (When you enter the Dungeon, you will start on the floor one higher than your ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 465.00 507.40  (Experience Level.  Each mazelike level will vary in size; the lower you go, the possibility of ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 450.60 507.40  (a larger floor size.  Do not bother keeping maps, as each level is randomly generated each ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 436.20 510.70  (time you enter.  The top half of your screen holds a top-view of the current dungeon floor.  ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 421.80 507.40  (The player's position  is highlighted as -YOU-.  The bottom half of the screen is for a ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 407.40 507.40  (rolling, text display.  The prompts will guide the player along their adventure.  Please note ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 393.00 507.40  (that the dungeon will accept most cursor keys as a substitute for the directions, North, ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 378.60 103.20  (South, East, West.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 349.80 471.40  (The Dungeon is filled with monsters to slay, most of them commensurate in might ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 335.40 507.40  (to the Dungeon level.  On occasion, though, a more powerful creature will work its way up ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 321.00 507.40  (to one of the higher levels, so watch out.  Sometimes you will find another user on the ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 306.60 507.40  (Dungeon level matching their Experience Level.  Some monsters keep maps of the ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 292.20 507.40  (Dungeon level they are on.  If you find one, you will be able to display all rooms on that ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 277.80 507.40  (level.  If your Intellect is above 50, you will be able to keep a map of all the rooms you have ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 263.40 126.90  (been in.  A key follows:) js
