108.00 166.60 425.70  (it.  Or ye can do battle against another mangy cur like yerself and lay claim to their booty.  But if ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 154.60 264.20  (ye think ye'll be doin' some fishin' for relaxation, think again!") js
0 100 12.00 /NewCenturySchlbk-Roman /font6 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 126.60 471.40  (In the Naval Area, you must first visit the Shipyard to buy a boat once you have ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 112.20 507.40  (saved up enough money.  You can then arm it with a ram and one cannon per 50 Hull ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 97.80 507.40  (Points.  Once you have made your purchase, you can hunt either denizens of the deep or ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 83.40 507.40  (other users.  Hitting "L" will display which users have ships, as well as how powerful those ) js
