0 15 div sg
72.00 755.40 507.40  (ships are.  Each time you log on your Hull Points are restored, though lost Hull Points can ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 741.00 272.90  (be repaired in the Shipyard during the same call.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 712.20 471.40  (From this menu you can also fish, which will yield some interesting results.  I will ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 697.80 507.40  (not spoil the fun by telling you everything that can be caught, but the higher your ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 683.40 507.40  (Charisma, the better chance you have of catching beneficial items.  You will, on occasion, ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 669.00 507.40  (catch oysters - the value of their pearls are based directly on how many cannons your ship ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 654.60 26.20  (has. ) js
0 100 24.00 /NewCenturySchlbk-Bold /font5 font
0 15 div sg
245.70 601.80 156.70  (Party Fights) js
0 100 10.00 /AvGuard-Italic /font7 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 555.40 405.30  ("There's strength in numbers, but four cowardly gnats like yerself still won't amount to much.  ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 543.40 419.20  (Others got the same idea, an' they'll be more than happy to show ye THEIR strength.  If ye think ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 531.40 410.30  (yer gang's tough enough, take on the Monster Mash an' see how some REAL partyin's done!") js
0 100 12.00 /NewCenturySchlbk-Roman /font6 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 503.40 471.40  (To get in on Party Fights, you must either join an existing gang or start one of your ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 489.00 507.40  (own.  To see if there are any openings, select "L" to list all gangs.  Any that have slots ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 474.60 507.40  (saying "-empty-" are available for your membership.  Alternately, a gang leader may invite ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 460.20 507.40  (you into a party - you will receive the invitation in your notes when you log on.  Listing ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 445.80 507.40  (gangs at this point will show your handle with \(Invited\) after it in the party into which ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 431.40 507.40  (your presence has been requested.  You may want to check the Most Wanted List to ensure ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 417.00 507.40  (that the gang you are about to join does not have a past history of taking a beating on a ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 402.60 499.80  (regular basis.  You may resign from a gang, if you have not used your party fight that call.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 373.80 471.40  (If you would like to form your own Party, simply select "S".  You will then be asked ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 359.40 507.40  (to supply a name for your gang.  Once that is complete, you can edit the gang, inviting ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 345.00 507.40  (potential teammates.  Do not invite users that are already in a gang - chances are slim ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 330.60 507.40  (they will leave theirs for yours.  The perfect gang combination consists of a heavy-hitter ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 316.20 507.40  (\(Barbarian, Fighter, or Ranger\), poison-using class \(Alchemist, Assassin, Thief\), ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 301.80 507.40  (magic-using \(Sage, Magician, Cleric, Jester\), and jack-of-all-trades \(Bard or Rogue\).  Keep ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 287.40 507.40  (this in mind when selecting other members.  If you do not invite specific users into the ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 273.00 221.60  (gang, any user has the option of joining.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 244.20 471.40  (As gang leader, you may have the option to replace undesirables at any time.  If you ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 229.80 507.40  (would like to put someone else in charge, you can use "T" to Transfer Leadership.  Note ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 215.40 485.60  (that if a member of your Party kills you, that person automatically assumes leadership.) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 186.60 471.40  (Any of the four, possible members that have joined the gang may initiate combat ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 172.20 507.40  (with another Party.  Only gang members with Alive! status can participate in the gang ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 157.80 507.40  (battle.  Any time another Party is defeated, the victors divide the spoils \(based on ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 143.40 507.40  (Experience Levels\) of all money that was in the losing gang members' hands.  If the ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 129.00 507.40  (defeated gang was powerful enough, you will also gain a level.  Be sure to use "Y" to check ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 114.60 507.40  (your statistics during battle, and keep in mind that discretion is indeed the better part of ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 100.20 507.40  (valor - if your Party is defeated, you will be logged off.  If you are defeated during the fight, ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 85.80 494.20  (your call will only continue if you go up an Experience Level and receive more Hit Points.) js
