108.00 282.60 471.40  (You enter the Tavern and are amazed by the size of the barkeep - he must stand ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 268.20 507.40  (over seven feet tall.  His appearance - and abnormal height - lead you to believe that ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 253.80 507.40  (human blood is not the only type flowing through his veins.  He finishes drying a flagon, ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 239.40 507.40  (places it with several others, and makes an adjustment to the sword hanging above his ) js
0 15 div sg
72.00 225.00 261.10  (mantle.  He then turns toward you and speaks.) js
0 100 10.00 /AvGuard-Italic /font7 font
0 15 div sg
108.00 197.80 425.10  ("New customer, huh?  OK, here's the rules, and I'm only gonna tell ya once, punk.  There's some ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 185.80 404.10  (rough-housing that goes on here, so I'll letcha get away with three brawls.  A lotta loose talk ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 173.80 425.20  (breezes through here, so you'll wanna keep your ears cocked as well.  If you wanna keep up on ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 161.80 433.30  (what's going on in the world, I keep a couple of newspapers lying around here to read.  He points ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 149.80 434.40  (a meaty finger at a chart on the wall and continues.  "Other people put bounties on the ones that ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 137.80 431.60  (done them wrong.  You can put up one of your own, chalk's right there on the sill.  Me, I've seen it ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 125.80 423.40  (all working here - gimme a decent tip and I'll give ya one right back.  But you'd best watch your ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 113.80 421.50  (mouth, punk, or I'll take ya down a notch.  I can stand a little abuse, but some things I just don't ) js
0 15 div sg
108.00 101.80 323.30  (tolerate."  With that, he flexes a mighty bicep and continues his cleaning.) js
